<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 73.2312 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 73.2312 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 73.2312 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday from 73.0671 on Friday.</p>
<p>				    Dec 23		  Dec 20</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  73.2312		 73.0671</p>
<p>    volume ($ million)	 5.550		   5.265</p>
<p>    tenge per mark	    47.2600		 47.3333</p>
<p>    volume ( DM million)     0.245		   0.030</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom,+ 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
